@StoryFunTimeApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220

### Try without logging in - should fail with 401
GET {{StoryFunTimeApi_HostAddress}}/books

### Log in to get a fresh token
POST {{StoryFunTimeApi_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Paste the token from the login response above into here, then run this
GET {{StoryFunTimeApi_HostAddress}}/books
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlMmQxZWY5Yi1mNmIyLTQxMjItYjVhMC1kOTYxZmY1MmMzNGYiLCJlbWFpbCI6InlvdUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImV4cCI6MTc4NzYzMTE0OSwiaXNzIjoiU3RvcnlGdW5UaW1lQXBpIiwiYXVkIjoiU3RvcnlGdW5UaW1lQXBwIn0.LlS0SljSe8DzjxkrfDoPukZBIMFaE0Usi-cZ6v0YAyk

### Create a book while logged in
POST {{StoryFunTimeApi_HostAddress}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlMmQxZWY5Yi1mNmIyLTQxMjItYjVhMC1kOTYxZmY1MmMzNGYiLCJlbWFpbCI6InlvdUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImV4cCI6MTc4NzYzMTE0OSwiaXNzIjoiU3RvcnlGdW5UaW1lQXBpIiwiYXVkIjoiU3RvcnlGdW5UaW1lQXBwIn0.LlS0SljSe8DzjxkrfDoPukZBIMFaE0Usi-cZ6v0YAyk

